{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/386641-using-awakening-diablerie-mexico-with-wraith","id":386641,"title":"Using Awakening Diablerie Mexico with Wraith","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-30T13:32:24-08:00","id":386641,"title":"Using Awakening Diablerie Mexico with Wraith","content":"I was looking for some quick ideas to tweak my ongoing plot. Currently the players are after a Vampire Necromancy tome in order to better understand the magic that the Black Hand is utilizing. I'm going to use the story from Awakening Diablerie Mexico. One of the players has Inhabit at level four and Puppetry at 1. The other has Lifeweb at five and Usury at 3. For an adventure solely in the Skinlands, what are some ideas you might have on how to allow them to cross over? The Monitor is willing to become a Risen for a short time, but the Artificer has explicitly stated his former body was obliterated when he died. Any takers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3138-old-rusty-pipe","name":"Old Rusty Pipe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T01:12:47-08:00","id":387157,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">If crossing the Shroud is absolutely necessary, you could throw in a plot device Artifact that mimics the effects of Embody 4. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T07:03:29-08:00","id":387339,"title":"","content":"Somehow I didn't even think about Embody at all. I'll let the Artificer have a temporarily empowered relic with Embody 4. I think that will allow for the appropriate interaction while keeping the player wanting to save its limited number of uses for the right moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3138-old-rusty-pipe","name":"Old Rusty Pipe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T07:17:28-08:00","id":387350,"title":"","content":"I'd say the Artificer at the least has other methods to cross the Shroud, riding along human through Puppetry 1 or possessing a Machine with Inhabit 4 (actually I think 3 is enough to take control of a machine), while the Monitor actually has no methods to do so, to Rise he would need to learn Puppetry up to three if I remember correctly. Just noting that unless you have a good amount of downtime, and he has a nice chunk of exp ready, the Monitor has no method of crossing the shroud at all so perhaps that artifact should go to him/her instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T11:25:37-08:00","id":387502,"title":"","content":"One uses the Embody Artifact then goes and buys a drone for the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T06:31:21-07:00","id":436968,"title":"","content":"Someone in my new group had an idea for a wraith to use Inhabit to get into Facebook and create an avatar for itself there. Now that would be cool. Of course, he or she wouldn't be able to do much in the physical world beyond having a personality, but with the darkside of the net could hire agents with BitCoins and the like. If they were really creative, they could create local activist groups online, and steer them into doing their bidding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}